],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjcj_Dzy9KWAxUviK8BHav2IwIQ3IcHCJsBKBc",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["🏡裝潢有濃厚的日式風情，採光不均、中間座位區稍微暗一些；桌面偏小、桌距近，但在非用餐顛峰期，內用還算舒適。\n\n🙋店剛開我們就到訪，店員即便在忙著備餐，仍蠻有禮貌的應對，期間也會幫忙調整湯頭鹹淡，服務加分!\n\n🍽️東京蒜味豚骨拉麵，入口是溫和的蒜香，湯頭選淡、調味剛好，叉燒肉薄度、肥瘦都適中，溏心蛋好吃，木耳絲脆口，麵條選軟、口感不爛，但下回想試正常硬度~\n🍽️醇香博多豚骨拉麵，濃郁的大骨香氣，湯頭選淡、調味還是偏鹹(可請店員幫忙調整)\n*二碗配料都是叉燒肉2片、溏心蛋半顆、木耳絲、蔥花\n🍽️日式豬排，麵衣酥、肉質紮實帶Q彈，看似很油卻不會膩口，還不錯~\n🍽️香煎干貝，組合貝、口感微Q、無甜味、無腥味，上面放一點XO醬(?)提味\n🍵大麥紅茶，內用自取，茶香不澀、甜度約一分，好喝~\n\n📝個人總結：今日初訪，選了二種湯頭，個人比較喜歡東京蒜味，雖然蒜香蓋過了大骨，但口感比較溫順好喝；拉麵配料有些單調，麵條份量多、男生可以吃很飽，定價合理、套餐划算。",null,[0,102]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12378313072880843881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjR1JtWVZwbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12378313072880843881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjR1JtWVZwbkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12378313072880843881/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjR1JtWVZwbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12378313072880843881/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjR1JtWVZwbkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12378313072880843881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjR1JtWVZwbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12378313072880843881/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFjR1JtWVZwbkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,14416,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQcGRmYVpnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x326a4899c87a5672!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDPpdfaZg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQcGRmYVpnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQcGRmYVpnEi0KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRFBwZGZhNWdFEhJDZ3NJNH